  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing climate change resilience in remote coastal communities of the Macuata province</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the action is to to increase resilience of forest and marine ecosystems to the adverse impacts of climate change in remote coastal communities of Macuata province.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
